{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE4L1RoZSUyMFJvY2tldCUyMCUyODIwMTglMjkv","type":"movie","name":"The Rocket","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/RODAohboSiIGcjUmDd0laMcLuB.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vFexiCtPXEkwzrgBLX3W6Av8xh.jpg","description":"“The Rocket\" is a small town story inspired by true events, about a high school football star who suffers a severe head injury and loses his entire life plan. The heaviness of a broken relationship with his father, and losing the identity of \"football star\" push him to seek a new way to prove himself. Restricted from playing any sports and despite being an unlikely runner, the cross country coach brings the young man aboard his high school team out of necessity, and through much struggle, doubt, and determination, he finds a new way to push towards greatness.  With colorful characters, youthful insights, and nostalgic storytelling, \"The Rocket\" brings together the elements of family, loss, failure, and redemption. The entire story is based on real characters and events that took place in the mid-west in 1999.\n\nReleased 23 Jan 2018 · United States of America · Language: English · 89 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["Family","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.6","imdb_id":"tt5181834","moviedb_id":500404,"tmdbId":500404,"runtime":"89 min","cast":["Brady Tutton","Richard Blake","Allison Belmont","Michael Mayfield","Leah Schiman","Nickolaus Schnetzky","Patrick Webb","Grayson Alexander Miller"],"director":["Richard Blake"],"writer":["Richard Blake"],"released":"2018-01-23T00:00:00.000Z","country":"United States of America","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Richard Blake","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hf0KkywUfyp07UCJGABubsbV95s.jpg"},{"name":"Brady Tutton","character":"Joshua Davis","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eFbh00Y2qJDclpxK96aLOSNpeD0.jpg"},{"name